    "bcItem1": "At early crop stage (15-30 days after sowing): Release egg parasitoid. Trichogramma pretiosum @ 3 cards (50000 eggs)/acre - two times at 15 days interval. (Egg cards are available at NBAIR, Hebbal and RCIPMC, Kadugodi, Bangalore and State biocontrol labs).",
    "monItem2": "Mid stage (30-50 days after sowing) - 10-20% damaged plants.",
