    "monItem1": "Early to mid whorl stage (15-30 days after sowing) - 5 to 10% damaged plants.",
    "monItem3": "Install pheromone traps @ 4/acre soon after sowing and monitor moth catches.",
    "biologicalSolutions": "Biological Solutions",
    "pmItem3": "Intercrop/Alley/Mixed crop of maize with suitable pulse crops of particular region (pigeon pea/black gram/green gram).",
