    "ccItem3": "Collection and destruction of egg masses and neonate larvae whenever seen in the field.",
    "ccItem2": "Application of 5% NSKE / neem formulation - Azadirachtin 10000 ppm @ 2 ml per liter of water to kill eggs and neonate larvae.",
    "phItem3": "Community action for mass trapping will give successful control.",
